              "type": "text",
              "text": "05 构图、曝光与动作",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-techniques",
          "type": "columnList",
          "props": {},
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "demo-techniques-0",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "width": 1
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "demo-wide-title",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "环境人像",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "demo-wide",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "props": {},
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "35mm 起步，人物放在画面三分之一处，保留江面与桥梁延伸方向。机位略低于眼睛，桥梁保持水平；人物与栏杆留出距离，先横后竖各拍一组。",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-techniques-1",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "width": 1
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "demo-light-title",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "日落逆光",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "demo-light",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "props": {},
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "50–85mm，f/2.8–4；移动人物从 1/500s 起步，Auto ISO 按现场调整。用侧逆光勾勒轮廓，检查面部曝光与伞面高光；需要时用白色反光板轻补。",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-techniques-2",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "width": 1
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "demo-blue-title",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "蓝调收尾",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "demo-blue",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "props": {},
                  "children": [],
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "先保住人脸和桥灯层次，允许背景略暗；静止姿态从 1/160s 起步，提高 ISO 而非让人物拖影。统一白平衡，拍一张干净桥景作为组照收尾。",
                      "styles": {}
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "demo-shot-rhythm",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {},
          "children": [],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "每个机位按远景交代环境 → 中景表现动作 → 特写补充情绪的顺序拍摄。先示范动作，再短连拍 3–5 张；每组回看眼睛清晰度、表情、衣摆和背景穿帮，合格后再换机位。参数仅为起点，按实际光线与焦段调整。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
